'''Atonement for Sin''' is the fifth stage in [[Humanity Catified]]. Clearing this [[No Continues]] stage gives access to the [[True Form]] evolutions of the first four [[Uncanny Legends]] drop units and unlocks [[Seven Lights of Doom (Merciless)|Mining Epic]], a stage that drops the necessary associated materials.

