==Strategy==
A way to approach this stage is to quickly rush down the initial bosses, Dogumaru and Urs, so that you can fight Naala alone with the occasional Doron as support. Unlike his previous appearances, Doron only shows up 5 times in this stage rather than 7, so if you are able to survive until all Dorons are gone, then Naala will fall eventually. It is also possible to rush the stage and destroy the base before Naala or any Dorons spawn, which will require units with high DPS.

Keep in mind: nothing in this stage spawns infinitely, meaning there is a makeshift time limit before the Sir Seals deplete and you run out of money to use, which could be detrimental if any boss still remains when that happens.

